        "flex_direction": "row-reverse",
        "flex_direction_alter": "column",
        "title": "",
        "paragraph": "<h2>Single vision</h2><p>Single vision lenses focus on one type of vision correction, making them perfect if you're nearsighted, farsighted, or have astigmatism. They’re not designed to multitask for multiple vision needs, but they excel at providing clear vision for a single issue. PRO RX TIP: a blank ‘Add’ field indicates a Single Vision lens has been prescribed.</p><h2>Premium Progressive</h2><p>Progressive lenses are ideal for anyone needing multiple vision corrections, like both nearsightedness and farsightedness. With our proprietary cutting edge digital design, they cleverly blend different prescription areas on the lens, giving you a smooth and uninterrupted look. PRO RX TIP: a power in the ‘Add’ field indicates a Progressive/multifocal lens has been prescribed.</p>",
        "paragraph_size": "small",
        "cta_text": "",
