        "text_YzG4m8": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Standard Slim",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Standard Slim</p>",
            "paragraph": "<p>Slim lenses combine sleek design with 100% UV and scratch protection, making them the perfect blend of style and durability. Ideal for lighter prescriptions ranging from +3.00 to –4.00, these lightweight plastic lenses keep your vision sharp and your eyewear effortlessly chic.</p>",
            "paragraph_size": "small",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": "",
            "text_alignment": "start",
            "text_alignment_alter": "start"
          }
        },
        "text_yxtcge": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Ultra Thin Hi-Index",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Ultra Thin Hi-Index</p>",
            "paragraph": "<p>Ultra-Thin Hi Index lenses are 30% lighter and 50% thinner, making them THE perfect choice for stronger prescriptions from +5.00 to –12.00. With 100% UV and scratch protection, these sleek lenses deliver high-performance clarity that doesn’t compromise style or comfort.</p>",
            "paragraph_size": "small",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": "",
            "text_alignment": "start",
            "text_alignment_alter": "start"
          }
        },
        "text_fMe9RE": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Premium Polycarbonate",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Premium Polycarbonate</p>",
            "paragraph": "<p>Premium polycarbonate lenses are the #1 choice for durability and lightweight comfort, ideal for prescriptions ranging from +4.00 to –9.00. Recommended by U.S. Federal guidelines for minors 18 and younger, these lenses offer superior impact resistance, 100% UV protection, and scratch resistance, making them the perfect blend of safety and style.</p>",
            "paragraph_size": "small",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": "",
            "text_alignment": "start",
            "text_alignment_alter": "start"
          }
        },
        "text_eDnXEF": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Blue Light from BlueTech",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Blue Light from BlueTech</p>",
            "paragraph": "<p>Blue light lenses are your screen-time sidekick, ideally in our best selling polycarbonate for a wide range of prescriptions. Blocking harmful blue light rays, they reduce eye strain and improve sleep after long hours of scrolling. With 5x the protection of standard clear lenses embedded in the lens, they’re 100% UV and scratch protected, resistant to fading, cracking, or peeling, and feature blue light protection in a clear lens. Befitting.com exclusively offers premium BluTech® Everyday lenses for ultimate digital eye defense. Learn more about the benefits of wearing BluTech® lenses.</p>",
            "paragraph_size": "small",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": "",
            "text_alignment": "start",
            "text_alignment_alter": "start"
          }
        }
