        "paragraph": "<h2>Anti-reflective</h2><p>Anti-reflective lenses are like magic for your glasses, banishing unwanted reflections and glare. They make your lenses almost invisible, so your eyes can shine through without any distractions. Say goodbye to pesky reflections and hello to crystal-clear vision!</p><h2>Premium anti-reflective</h2><p>Premium anti-reflection coating keeps your vision sharp and your lenses crystal clear by reducing glare. With oleophobic and hydrophobic protection, it repels fingerprints, smudges, water, and dirt. This coating offers the ultimate clarity and durability, making every day wear effortless.</p>",
