    "global_4_column_grid_9AqECK": {
      "type": "global-4-column-grid",
      "blocks": {
        "text_cyaAmE": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Sunglasses",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Sunglasses</p>",
            "paragraph": "<p>Our sunglasses combine style and function with lightweight polycarbonate lenses for unbeatable comfort. Available in sleek grey, warm brown, and dark green, they offer superb UV protection, and a chic look for any occasion.</p>",
            "paragraph_size": "small",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": "",
            "text_alignment": "start",
            "text_alignment_alter": "start"
          }
        },
        "text_f7fbib": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Prescription Sun",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Prescription Sun</p>",
            "paragraph": "<p>Prescription sun lenses are like your regular glasses but with a sunny twist! They come with your personalized prescription, so you can see clearly while protecting your eyes from harmful UV rays. Say goodbye to squinting and hello to stylish eye protection tailored just for you!</p>",
            "paragraph_size": "small",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": "",
            "text_alignment": "start",
            "text_alignment_alter": "start"
          }
        },
        "text_6XyNmX": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Polarized Tinted Lenses",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Polarized Tinted Lenses</p>",
            "paragraph": "<p>Polarized tinted lenses are designed to combat harsh white glare from reflective surfaces like roads or snow, offering you clear, vibrant vision. Combining a precise tint with a polarized filter, these lenses enhance contrast and reduce eye strain, while providing 100% UV protection and scratch resistance for durability. Perfect for bright days when you need both style and performance.</p>",
            "paragraph_size": "small",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": "",
            "text_alignment": "start",
            "text_alignment_alter": "start"
          }
        },
        "text_P4EiiB": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Tinted Lenses",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Tinted Lenses</p>",
            "paragraph": "<p>Tinted lenses offer a stylish way to reduce glare and improve visual comfort by filtering out excess light. They provide 100% UV protection to shield your eyes from harmful rays and come with scratch resistance to keep your lenses looking sharp. Ideal for sunny days when you want to blend form and function effortlessly. Available in grey, green, and brown.</p>",
            "paragraph_size": "small",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": "",
            "text_alignment": "start",
            "text_alignment_alter": "start"
          }
        }
